ingroup: 227 non-vaccine LSDV genomes
outgroup: 50 SPPV + GTPV genomes
ancestral posterior probability threshold: 0.9

60 genes analysed
121 fixed differences on the LSDV branch
  non-synonymous 60
  synonymous     61

Against the MK test: Dn 74.8 + Ds 83.2 = 158.0 substitutions,
versus 121 changed codons here, a ratio of 1.31 substitutions per codon. Nei-Gojobori
averages over pathways, so a codon differing at two or three positions
contributes more than one; a ratio between 1 and 2 is expected and
means the two counts agree. A ratio near 1 or above 2 would not.

